/**
 * @page supported_compilers Supported Compilers
 *
 * RAZE requires a C++23-compliant compiler. Using older versions may result in compilation failures due 
 * to missing C++23 language or standard library features.
 *
 * ### Compiler Support
 *
 * | Compiler | Minimum Version |
 * | :--- | :--- |
 * | **GCC** | 14.1 |
 * | **clang** | 18.1 |
 * | **clang-cl** | 18.1 |
 * | **MSVC** | 19.35 (VS 2022 17.5) |
 * | **icpx** | 2025.0 (oneAPI) |
 * | **AOCC** | 6.0 |
 * | **nvc++** | 24.3 (NVIDIA HPC SDK) |
 *
 * ### Compiler-Specific Behaviors
 *
 * - **Dynamic Dispatch & Auto-Vectorization**: MSVC dispatches explicit `raze::vx` SIMD kernels via
 *   CPUID detection at program startup. GCC, Clang, Clang-CL, AOCC, `nvc++`, and `icpx` additionally
 *   support ISA-targeted multiversioning for compiler auto-vectorized (`autovec`) kernels.
 *   See @ref dynamic_dispatch and @ref vectorization_semantics for details.
 */